\hline
\textbf{Sample Rate (Hz)} & \textbf{Settling Time (ms)} & \textbf{Overshoot (\%)} & \textbf{Oscillation?} & \textbf{Stable?} \\
\hline
500 & & & & \\
\hline
200 & & & & \\
\hline
100 & & & & \\
\hline
50 & & & & \\
\hline
